{"seq":3,"slug":"refs-branches","title":"引用与分支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/foundations/refs-branches","wordCount":1270,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"引用与分支\">引用与分支</h1><p><a href=\"git-object-model\">Git 对象模型</a> 揭示了一个不太友好的事实：所有提交都用 40 位十六进制哈希来标识。没人愿意记住或敲 <code>a1b2c3d4...</code> 这样的字符串。<strong>引用（ref）</strong> 就是为此而生——它给某个对象哈希起一个人类可读的名字。一旦你接受「分支只是一行文本、HEAD 只是一个指针」这个朴素事实，分离 HEAD、强制推送、误删分支恢复这些让初学者头疼的现象就会瞬间变得透明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个 ref 在最朴素的形态下，就是 <code>.git/refs/</code> 下的一个文件，内容是一行 40 位哈希。<code>refs/heads/main</code> 这个文件里写着某个 commit 的哈希，这就是「main 分支」的全部秘密——它不是一段历史，而是一个<strong>指向某个 commit 的可移动指针</strong>。Git 里几乎所有「名字」都是 ref 的某种形态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分支</strong>（<code>refs/heads/*</code>）：指向 commit 的可移动指针，提交时自动前移。</li>\n<li><strong>远程跟踪分支</strong>（<code>refs/remotes/origin/*</code>）：记录「上次同步时远程那个分支指向哪」，本地只读。</li>\n<li><strong>标签</strong>（<code>refs/tags/*</code>）：指向某个对象的指针，通常不移动。</li>\n<li><strong>HEAD</strong>：一个特殊的「指向当前所在位置」的 ref，决定下次提交挂在哪。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下图展示这些 ref 如何同时指向同一张对象图的不同节点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  HEAD[HEAD] --&gt; MAIN[refs/heads/main]&#10;  MAIN --&gt; C3[commit C3]&#10;  FEAT[refs/heads/feature] --&gt; C4[commit C4]&#10;  ORIGIN[refs/remotes/origin/main] --&gt; C2[commit C2]&#10;  TAG[refs/tags/v1.0] --&gt; C2&#10;  C3 --&gt; C2&#10;  C4 --&gt; C2&#10;  C2 --&gt; C1[commit C1]\">graph TD\n  HEAD[HEAD] --&gt; MAIN[refs/heads/main]\n  MAIN --&gt; C3[commit C3]\n  FEAT[refs/heads/feature] --&gt; C4[commit C4]\n  ORIGIN[refs/remotes/origin/main] --&gt; C2[commit C2]\n  TAG[refs/tags/v1.0] --&gt; C2\n  C3 --&gt; C2\n  C4 --&gt; C2\n  C2 --&gt; C1[commit C1]</pre><p>下表澄清几类 ref 的区别。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>ref 类型</th>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>是否随提交移动</th>\n<th>谁来更新</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分支</td>\n<td>refs/heads/*</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>本地提交自动前移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程跟踪分支</td>\n<td>refs/remotes/*</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>fetch/push 时更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻量标签</td>\n<td>refs/tags/*</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附注标签</td>\n<td>refs/tags/* → tag 对象</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>手动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HEAD</td>\n<td>.git/HEAD</td>\n<td>间接</td>\n<td>checkout/commit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"head-你-当前在哪\">HEAD：你「当前在哪」</h2><p>HEAD 是理解 Git 当前状态的核心。正常情况下，<code>.git/HEAD</code> 文件里不是哈希，而是一个<strong>符号引用</strong>：<code>ref: refs/heads/main</code>。这叫「HEAD 附着在某个分支上」。当你提交时，Git 做两步：创建新 commit，然后让 HEAD 所指的那个分支（main）前移到新 commit。注意移动的是分支，HEAD 只是间接跟着走。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"$ cat .git/HEAD&#10;ref: refs/heads/main          # 符号引用：附着在 main 上&#10;&#10;$ git checkout a1b2c3d         # 检出一个具体提交&#10;$ cat .git/HEAD&#10;a1b2c3d4e5f6...               # 直接是哈希：分离 HEAD\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ref:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> refs/heads/main</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 符号引用：附着在 main 上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> a1b2c3d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 检出一个具体提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">a1b2c3d4e5f6...</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 直接是哈希：分离 HEAD</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"分离-head-不是-bug\">分离 HEAD 不是 bug</h2><p>当你 <code>git checkout &lt;某个哈希或标签&gt;</code>，HEAD 不再写 <code>ref: ...</code>，而是直接写那个哈希——这就是<strong>分离 HEAD（detached HEAD）</strong>。它经常吓到新人，但其实毫无神秘：此时 HEAD 没附着在任何分支上，你照样能看代码、能提交，只是你新建的提交没有分支名指着它。一旦你切走，这些提交就成了「没有 ref 指向的悬空提交」，会在未来某次 <code>gc</code> 时被回收。</p>\n<p>这恰恰解释了「我在分离 HEAD 状态下做的提交怎么不见了」：不是丢了，是没给它起名字。解决办法很简单——在切走前 <code>git switch -c new-branch</code> 给当前位置安一个分支 ref。即使你已经切走、提交看似消失，也能通过 <a href=\"../internals/reflog-recovery\">reflog 与数据恢复</a> 找回，因为对象本身还在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"创建分支为什么是-o-1\">创建分支为什么是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></h2><p>在 SVN 里建分支往往意味着复制整个目录树，又慢又占空间。Git 建分支只是<strong>写一个 41 字节的文件</strong>（40 位哈希加换行），无论仓库多大都瞬间完成。设仓库有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个提交、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个文件，SVN 风格分支的成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而 Git 分支的成本是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mtext>git branch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≪</mo><msub><mtext>cost</mtext><mtext>svn branch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cost}_{\\text{git branch}} = O(1) \\ll \\text{cost}_{\\text{svn branch}} = O(M)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">git branch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">svn branch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为分支只是指针，不复制任何对象图节点。这个性质是 Git「鼓励频繁、廉价地开分支」这一整套工作流的物理基础——后面 <a href=\"../workflows-scale/branching-strategies\">分支策略</a> 里所有「短生命周期分支」的实践，都建立在「开分支几乎零成本」之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轻量标签与附注标签\">轻量标签与附注标签</h2><p>标签有两种，区别值得讲清。<strong>轻量标签</strong>就是 <code>refs/tags/</code> 下一个直接写着 commit 哈希的文件，和分支几乎一样，只是约定上不移动。<strong>附注标签</strong>则会先创建一个真正的 <strong>tag 对象</strong>（<a href=\"git-object-model\">对象模型</a> 里的第四种对象），里面记录打标签者、时间、说明，还能 GPG 签名，然后 ref 指向这个 tag 对象而非直接指向 commit。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  LT[轻量标签&lt;br/&gt;refs/tags/v1-light] --&gt; C[commit]&#10;  AT[附注标签&lt;br/&gt;refs/tags/v1.0] --&gt; TO[tag 对象&lt;br/&gt;含签名/说明]&#10;  TO --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  LT[轻量标签&lt;br/&gt;refs/tags/v1-light] --&gt; C[commit]\n  AT[附注标签&lt;br/&gt;refs/tags/v1.0] --&gt; TO[tag 对象&lt;br/&gt;含签名/说明]\n  TO --&gt; C</pre><p>发布版本时应当用附注标签（<code>git tag -a v1.0 -m &quot;...&quot;</code>），因为它携带「谁在何时为何发布」的可审计信息，且可被签名验证。日常临时打点用轻量标签即可。这些 ref 如何在两台机器间同步、远程跟踪分支如何更新，是 <a href=\"../core-operations/remotes-sync\">远程与同步</a> 的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ref 是给对象哈希起的人类可读名字，最朴素形态就是 <code>.git/refs/</code> 下一个写着哈希的文件。</li>\n<li>分支 = 指向 commit 的可移动指针，提交时自动前移；建分支只写一个文件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 成本。</li>\n<li>HEAD 通常是符号引用（<code>ref: refs/heads/main</code>），附着在分支上；提交时移动的是分支，HEAD 间接跟随。</li>\n<li>分离 HEAD 是 HEAD 直接指向哈希的正常状态；此时的提交没有分支名，可被 gc 回收，但能用 reflog 找回。</li>\n<li>轻量标签直接指 commit，附注标签指向一个含元数据与签名的 tag 对象，发布应用后者。</li>\n<li>「分支即廉价指针」是 <a href=\"../workflows-scale/branching-strategies\">分支策略</a> 全部工作流的物理前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"引用与分支","id":"引用与分支"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HEAD：你「当前在哪」","id":"head-你-当前在哪"},{"level":2,"text":"分离 HEAD 不是 bug","id":"分离-head-不是-bug"},{"level":2,"text":"创建分支为什么是 O(1)","id":"创建分支为什么是-o-1"},{"level":2,"text":"轻量标签与附注标签","id":"轻量标签与附注标签"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Git 对象模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/foundations/git-object-model"},"next":{"title":"提交与历史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/core-operations/commits-history"}}